{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KvXWBZFdpvsjjiWSkvMpG6","type":"tool_result","content":"**Density correlation (Eq. 1):**\n\n\"rho = 0.5082 - 1.0336x10\\-4 T\\* - 4.8279x10\\-10 T\\*2 - 5.2853x10\\-12 T\\*3 (1)\"\n\n- Where \"T\\* = (T - 271.7)\" and T is in degrees Celsius.\n- Density (rho) is in g/cm3.\n- Validity: 300 to 1000 C.\n\n**Self-diffusion data:** None is provided in the content.\n\n**Attached references:** The page does not cite a specific reference for Eq. 1. It states that the thermophysical data, which includes density, was \"collected on pure liquid lithium with respect to temperature, from ref [3-8].\" The references in that range are:\n\n3. I.I. Novikov et al., *High Temperature* 7 (1969)\n4. E.I. Gol'tsova, *High Temperature* 4 (1966)\n5. E.E. Shpil'rain et al., *High Temperature* 3 (1965)\n6. A.V. Grosse, *Revue Hautes Temp & Refrac.* (1966)\n7. J. Freund, *Thermophysical and Nuclear Parameters of Molten Li, Na, K, Rb and Cs* (1969)\n8. J. Wilson, *Met. Rev.* (1965)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a11176f-3086-43ac-8358-e42037899d12","uuid":"df811883-ddc7-4a2d-b275-eed8f63596a9","timestamp":"2026-11-01T08:41:40.497Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":10096,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Density correlation (Eq. 1):**\n\n\"rho = 0.5082 - 1.0336x10\\-4 T\\* - 4.8279x10\\-10 T\\*2 - 5.2853x10\\-12 T\\*3 (1)\"\n\n- Where \"T\\* = (T - 271.7)\" and T is in degrees Celsius.\n- Density (rho) is in g/cm3.\n- Validity: 300 to 1000 C.\n\n**Self-diffusion data:** None is provided in the content.\n\n**Attached references:** The page does not cite a specific reference for Eq. 1. It states that the thermophysical data, which includes density, was \"collected on pure liquid lithium with respect to temperature, from ref [3-8].\" The references in that range are:\n\n3. I.I. Novikov et al., *High Temperature* 7 (1969)\n4. E.I. Gol'tsova, *High Temperature* 4 (1966)\n5. E.E. Shpil'rain et al., *High Temperatu